# Repo-root Docker context excludes (services/Dockerfile builds from the root).
# BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore when present (services/Dockerfile.dockerignore);
# this file covers non-BuildKit builders. Secrets must never enter a build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*keypair*.json
**/id.json
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
chain/target
chain/.anchor
chain/test-ledger
services/var
